# Toolchain

| Concern | Required choice |
| --- | --- |
| Package manager | pnpm + Corepack |
| Library bundler | tsdown (ESM-first) |
| Catalog | Storybook on Vite |
| Tests | Vitest + Testing Library + axe |
| Lint | oxlint (no ESLint) |
| Format | oxfmt (no Prettier) |
| CSS lint | no Stylelint unless a hand-written CSS codebase appears |
| Git hooks | Lefthook + commitlint (Conventional Commits) |
| Versioning | Changesets + semver |
| Node | 22 |
| Module | ESM-only; React is a peer |
